//! The vector package: drawings `entelechy import` reads from SVG, filled
//! pixel by pixel on every backend alike. `graphs/draw.esn` draws the
//! shapes through a look, tiled, so each pixel asks only the shapes and
//! segments near it; `vector.draw@1` is the same rule asked of every
//! shape, the reference the tiled form is tested against.
//! `graphs/drawing.esn` draws one whole, fitted to the window.
package vector@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
